Ukraine has 50 '''Ramsar sites''' designated as ''[[List of Ramsar wetlands of international importance|Wetlands of International Importance]]''. Ramsar sites in [[Ukraine]] have a total surface area of approximately {{Convert|802604|ha|acre}}. The [[Ramsar Convention]] on Wetlands came into effect for Ukraine on 1 December 1991.<ref name="Ramsar list">{{cite web|title=Ramsar List|url=http://www.ramsar.org/pdf/sitelist.pdf|publisher=Ramsar.org|accessdate=31 March 2013}}</ref>
{{GeoGroup}}{{Clear}}

